%% Email draft/send — state machine + sequence (verified against 56c8dd2)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> editing: zimbra_send_email returns LOCAL draft (nothing stored, nothing sent)
    editing --> editing: user edits fields / add signature (list-signatures)
    editing --> discarded: discard
    discarded --> editing: Reopen
    editing --> sending: validation OK (≥1 To, subject) AND window.confirm('Send this email now?')
    editing --> failed: validation error (no confirm shown)
    sending --> sent: send-email RPC → result.sent === true
    sending --> failed: error / missing sent acknowledgment ("Zimbra did not confirm that the email was sent.")
    failed --> sending: Retry (confirm again)
    sent --> [*]
    note right of sending
        send-email RPC path (not an MCP tool):
        host.js requireUser → runAuthCommand('send-email', session_id)
        → control channel → ZimbraMailService.send_email
        → gate ZIMBRA_ALLOW_SEND
    end note
